WEBVTT

00:13:29.240 --> 00:13:31.906
And politicians on the basis
of a scorecard

00:13:31.930 --> 00:13:35.130
of how exactly they're
improving citizen lives.

00:13:37.117 --> 00:13:40.717
There are many broken systems
out there in the world.

00:13:41.236 --> 00:13:43.836
We need to bring back their motivation.

00:13:44.841 --> 00:13:46.888
The citizen is waiting.

00:13:47.397 --> 00:13:49.556
We must act today.

00:13:50.095 --> 00:13:51.444
Thank you very much.

00:13:51.468 --> 00:13:53.880
(Applause)